    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\dfrac72$ or $x=\\dfrac34$.\n\nFactorise as $(2x-7)(4x-3)=0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2x-7)(4x-3)&=0\\\\2x-7&=0\\text{ or }4x-3=0\\\\x&=\\frac72\\text{ or }x=\\frac34\\end{align*}$$",
